        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>engage,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνίων αὑτοὺς ἐνειληκότων οἰκονομίαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PTeb.</u>
					24.62
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>:—
				Pass.
